ssue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### [REQUIRED] Issue description\r\n`CastPlayer.getDuration()` always seems to return `-1000` when casting a live stream. This duration eventually becomes  the `TimeBar`'s duration, which causes the scrubber to disappear, leaving you unable to timeshift the live stream.\r\n\r\nI have tried setting the `StreamType` to `MediaInfo.STREAM_TYPE_LIVE`, but it didn't help.\r\n\r\nA possible workaround seems to be:\r\n```kotlin\r\noverride fun getDuration(): Long {\r\n    val remoteMediaClient = remoteMediaClient ?: return super.getDuration()\r\n    val seekableDuration = remoteMediaClient.approximateLiveSeekableRangeEnd - remoteMediaClient.approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart\r\n\r\n    return if (seekableDuration > 0) {\r\n        seekableDuration\r\n    } else {\r\n        super.getDuration() // seekableDuration is 0 for VODs\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, this doesn't solve the `TimeBar` issue, since its duration is based on the `Timeline`'s duration.\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Reproduction steps\r\n1. Cast a live stream\r\n2. Call `CastPlayer.getDuration()`\r\n3. The result of the above above function call is `-1000`\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Link to test content\r\nhttps://live.unified-streaming.com/scte35/scte35.isml/.mpd?dvr_window_length=3600\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] A full bug report captured from the device\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Version of ExoPlayer being used\r\n2.12.0\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Device(s) and version(s) of Android being used\r\n* LG H815 Android 9\r\n* Android 8 TV with built-in Chromecast","closed_by":{"login":"AquilesCanta","id":8539544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mzk1NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8539544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}